  "details": "# Issue:\n\nClicking on the \"Enter a search term\" button in the \"Find a Group\" Category of the Group Tab opens up a search interface in the Group Menu it self.\n\nThis is inconsistent with how the World and Avatar Tabs handle it. When clicking on the Search button in either of these two Tabs you will be brought to the Search Tab and can continue the Search from there.\n\n# Expected Behaviour:  \n\nClicking on the \"Enter a search term\" button in the \"Find a Group\" Category of the Group Tab should bring you to the Search Tab so that you can continue your Search from there.\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/ao84d4.mp4",
